# Application configuration delivered from GitHub Environment `prod` secrets.
# GitHub secret PROD_<NAME> becomes host variable <NAME> in root-only app.env.
# Mirrors APP_ENV_NAMES in mnema-deploy.py (a test keeps both equal) and the explicit
# env block of the deploy-production job. Host-generated secrets (database passwords,
# identity-signing.json, offsite.env) are never listed here.
# Adding a name = reviewed PR + administrator-installed dispatcher + explicit workflow env entry.
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
YANDEX_CLIENT_ID
YANDEX_CLIENT_SECRET
GH_CLIENT_ID
GH_CLIENT_SECRET
MNEMA_POSTBOX_ACCESS_KEY
MNEMA_POSTBOX_SECRET_KEY
MNEMA_PROMO_HASH_SECRET
MNEMA_EXPERIMENT_SECRET
MNEMA_EVENTS_OWNER_ACCOUNT_ID
MNEMA_ADMIN_OWNER_ACCOUNT_ID
MNEMA_ADMIN_SUPPORT_ENDPOINT
MNEMA_ADMIN_SUPPORT_SECRET
MNEMA_IDENTITY_TURNSTILE_MODE
LEARNING_MEDIA_UPLOAD_ACCESS_KEY
LEARNING_MEDIA_UPLOAD_SECRET_KEY
MNEMA_AVATAR_ACCESS_KEY
MNEMA_AVATAR_SECRET_KEY
MNEMA_BILLING_CHECKOUT
MNEMA_BILLING_TESTER_ACCOUNT_IDS
MNEMA_TBANK_TERMINAL_KEY
MNEMA_TBANK_PASSWORD_BASE64
MNEMA_NPD_RECEIPTS
MNEMA_NPD_INN
MNEMA_NPD_PASSWORD_BASE64
